    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Sarath Amunugama,Minister of Higher Education and Research, do by this order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act in relation to the Rajarata University of Sri Lankapublished in Gazette Extraordinary No. 896/2 of November 7, 1995 and as last amended by Order published in GazetteExtraordinary No. 1856/5 of March 31, 2014, by the subsitution for the item \u201cFacultry of Social Sciences and Humanities\u201dappearing in Column I of such Schedule and its corresponding entries appearing in Column II thereto, and the substitutiontherefore of the following :-",
